{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48968","headline":"送曾德迈归宁宜春 · 曹松","name":"送曾德迈归宁宜春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湘东山川有清辉，袁水词人得意归。\n几府争驰毛义檄，一乡看侍老莱衣。\n筵开灞岸临清浅，路去蓝关入翠微。\n想到宜阳更无事，并将欢庆奉庭闱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48968.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48968","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}